    ERIKA @ talk "\"내가 없는 동안 [regina_ref!t]를 잘 부탁해.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:234
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_4e1e6187:

    # ERIKA @ talk "And good luck for your results!"
    ERIKA @ talk "\"그리고 네 결과에 행운을 빌어!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:235
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_59de7aac:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Who knows! Perhaps you will have the honour of serving under me!"
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "\"누가 말했어?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:237
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_0d681a80:

    # MC "Me and Markus are hoping to celebrate after the results tonight, maybe we will see you out?"
    MC "\"나랑 마커스는 오늘 밤 결과 나온 후에 축하할 생각인데, 혹시 나올 거야?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:238
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_5b93ab95:

    # ERIKA @ talk "Again, unlikely I’m afraid."
    ERIKA @ talk "\"안타깝지만, 또 불가능할 것 같아.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:239
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_ecfcd90d:

    # REGINA @ talk "{i}*Ahem!*{/i} I hope neither of you are planning to get {i}too{/i} drunk at the tavern this evening!"
    REGINA @ talk "\"{i}*에헴!*{/i} 오늘 저녁에 선술집에서 {i}너무{/i} 취할 생각은 안 했으면 좋겠는데!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:240
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_ecc92bc3:

    # MC "... Noooooo."
    MC "\"... 아니야아아아.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:241
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_e987d6e9:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Enjoy yourselves."
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "\"즐겁게 지내라.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:243
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_752c3f2b:

    # "Making her way towards the door, she smiled and waved us farewell."
    "문 쪽으로 향하며, 그녀는 미소 지으며 우리에게 작별 인사를 건넸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:244
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_8d770731:

    # ERIKA "Love to you both! I shall return soon!"
    ERIKA "\"둘 다 사랑해! 곧 돌아올게!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:246
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_f74ba569:

    # MC "Bye, Erika."
    MC "\"잘 가, 에리카.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:247
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_1ac578c6:

    # REGINA @ talk "Come back soon!"
    REGINA @ talk "\"곧 다시 와!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:248
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_1f2326f6:

    # ERIKA "I’ll make sure to buy you a drink!"
    ERIKA "\"꼭 술 한 잔 살게!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:249
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_96e3aaae:

    # "And with that, she closed the door behind her, vanishing from our lives once again."
    "그리고 그 말과 함께, 그녀는 뒤로 문을 닫았고, 다시 한 번 우리 삶에서 사라져 갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:251
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_b85ff9fb:

    # REGINA @ talk "... Right, you should probably get going as well, you don’t want to be late."
    REGINA @ talk "\"... 그래, 너도 이제 가봐야 할 거야, 늦으면 안 되니까.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:252
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c63cccfb:

    # REGINA @ talk "Oh, and here by the way, I’ve got a special treat."
    REGINA @ talk "\"오, 그나저나 여기, 특별한 선물이 있어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:254
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_84c5d26e:

    # REGINA @ talk "Some grapes for you."
    REGINA @ talk "\"널 위한 포도야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:256
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c75261f5:

    # MC "... Are these {i}fresh?{/i} How did you afford them?"
    MC "\"... 이거 {i}생과일이야?{/i} 어떻게 살 돈이 있었어?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:257
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_60a64ecb:

    # REGINA @ lewd_talk "Oh, umm... I perhaps dipped into the savings a little for a special occasion such as this..."
    REGINA @ lewd_talk "\"오, 음... 이런 특별한 날을 위해 저축을 좀 썼을지도...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:258
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_d7e14922:

    # MC "[regina_ref_cap!t]!"
    MC "[regina_ref_cap!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:259
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_9e610ce5:

    # REGINA @ talk "Oh hush! I did the same for Erika when it was her time."
    REGINA @ talk "\"오, 조용히 해! 에리카 때도 내가 똑같이 해줬어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:260
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_02dde3ac:

    # MC "You shouldn’t have, it’s too expensive."
    MC "\"그러지 않아도 됐는데, 너무 비싸잖아.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:261
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_4dc4a3ba:

    # REGINA @ talk "I won’t hear none of it! It’s your big day!"
    REGINA @ talk "\"아무 말도 듣기 싫어! 네 중요한 날이야!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:262
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_52311849:

    # REGINA @ talk "Now, go on, shoo!"
    REGINA @ talk "\"자, 가, 저리가!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:263
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_18639b33:

    # REGINA @ talk "And you and Markus be safe!"
    REGINA @ talk "\"그리고 너와 마커스도 조심해!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:264
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_e465953b:

    # MC "Will do, [regina_ref!t]!"
    MC "\"그럴게요, [regina_ref!t]!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:265
translate kr qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_edc951fa:

    # MC "Be back soon!"
    MC "\"곧 돌아올게요!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:276
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a6bdbc8f:

    # "There were not many occasions that our walled off capital was able to put aside the bloodshed and horrors of the outside. But every year {i}the Terminus ceremony{/i} was one that found its citizens energised enough to celebrate with real cheer."
    "성벽으로 둘러싸인 우리 수도가 바깥의 유혈과 공포를 제쳐 둘 수 있는 기회는 그리 많지 않았다. 하지만 매년 {i}테르미누스 의식{/i}만은 시민들이 진정한 환호로 축하할 만큼 활기를 되찾는 날이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:277
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_47f5188c:

    # "Novaras did its best to welcome those who had completed their basic education course and were waiting to be assigned their jobs... {i} for life.{/i}"
    "노바라스는 기초 교육 과정을 마치고 직업 배정을 기다리는 이들을 최선을 다해 환영했다... {i}평생 직업을.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:278
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8277ff1c:

    # "Both me and Markus had worked tirelessly to push our performance up to the top of our class, often toiling away with studies deep into the night, trying to gain our position in the palace."
    "나와 마커스 둘 다 우리 성적을 반에서 최상위로 끌어올리기 위해 지칠 줄 모르고 노력했으며, 왕궁에 자리를 얻기 위해 밤늦도록 공부에 매달리곤 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:279
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_fd19327d:

    # "We often found ourselves fantasising in the early hours of the morning about how our lives would become a whirlwind of splendour far away from the hunger and drudgery of the {i}normal{/i} population."
    "우리는 종종 이른 새벽 시간에, {i}평범한{/i} 사람들의 굶주림과 고된 노동에서 멀리 떨어진 화려함의 소용돌이가 될 우리 삶에 대해 환상을 품곤 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:280
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_05d56647:

    # "A favourite topic of ours was, of course, the court ladies we would try to woo, successfully charming our way into their beds each night."
    "물론 우리가 가장 좋아하는 주제는 궁정 귀부인들이었다. 그녀들을 유혹해서 매일 밤 성공적으로 매료시켜 침실로 들이는 상상을 하곤 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:281
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_31c7bda4:

    # "And the food, OH THE FOOD! We could eat for days till our bellies were fat! No more scrapping over what we’d managed to cobble together. We would eat until our bellies were ready to burst! We often pondered on what it must feel like to be that wealthy."
    "그리고 음식, 아 그 음식이란! 배가 터질 때까지 며칠이고 먹을 수 있을 거라고! 더 이상 겨우 모은 찌꺼기를 두고 싸울 필요도 없을 거라고. 배가 터지기 직전까지 먹을 수 있을 거라고! 우리는 그렇게 부자가 되는 게 어떤 기분일지 자주 상상하곤 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:282
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_14f1250e:

    # "Ah... But first we had to reach our Terminus. As I made my way to the ceremony being held at the entrance to the palace, many people greeted me happily along the way."
    "아... 하지만 먼저 우리는 테르미누스를 맞이해야 했다. 왕궁 입구에서 열리는 의식으로 향하는 길에, 많은 사람들이 나를 반갑게 맞아 주었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:283
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_88534ba0:

    # "Patting me on the back with many ‘Good luck lads!’ and other courteous expressions of well-wishing for me, I basked in admiration, anxious..."
    "\"행운을 빈다, 친구!\" 같은 말과 함께 등을 두드리며 여러 정중한 축복 인사들을 받으면서, 나는 불안한 마음 속에서도 찬사를 만끽했다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:284
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2d015ebf:

    # "When I finally made it to the ceremony itself, hundreds of other students like me gathered around and chattered away, their excitement electric."
    "마침내 의식 장소에 도착했을 때, 나 같은 수백 명의 다른 학생들이 모여 떠들썩하게 수다를 떨고 있었고, 그들의 흥분은 전기처럼 짜릿했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:285
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_68c978d5:

    # "Thousands of commoners gathered to watch the affair from the sides with exuberant smiles on their faces. Confetti was gleefully thrown into the air as we all watched the podium, waiting for the speeches to begin before we’d formally be given our life duties."
    "수천 명의 평민들이 얼굴에 활기찬 미소를 띤 채 행사를 옆에서 지켜보기 위해 모였다. 색종이가 즐겁게 공중으로 뿌려졌고, 우리 모두는 연단을 바라보며 공식적으로 평생 직무가 주어지기 전 연설이 시작되기를 기다렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:289
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2098ea1a:

    # MARKUS "There you are!"
    MARKUS "\"거기 있었구나!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:290
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3c4cc504:

    # MC smile "Markus!"
    MC "smile  \"마커스!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:293
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_93aee4f6:

    # "Markus hurried over towards me, his voice palpable with excitement."
    "마커스가 흥분에 찬 목소리로 내게 급히 다가왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:294
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3b27e832:

    # MARKUS "I figured you were still passed out after all the drinking last night!"
    MARKUS "\"어젯밤에 그렇게 마셨으니 아직 곯아떨어져 있을 줄 알았지!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:295
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3fedadc7:

    # MC "Nah, not me! Already looking forward to tonight!"
    MC "\"아니, 나는 아니야! 벌써 오늘 밤이 기대되는걸!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:296
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_c0bb39a1:

    # MARKUS "That’s what we like to hear!"
    MARKUS "\"그거 우리가 듣고 싶던 말이야!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:297
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6e9b7663:

    # MC "I looked around to see where the rest of our class were, trying to pick out the individual faces of the crowd."
    MC "\"주변을 둘러보며 우리 반 친구들이 어디 있는지, 군중 속에서 낯익은 얼굴들을 찾아보려 애썼다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:298
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8af6c041:

    # MC "Did your brother make it?"
    MC "\"네 형은 왔어?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:299
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8651af28:

    # MARKUS "Hm? Oh no, Skallion’s busy down the mines today."
    MARKUS "\"응? 아, 아니. 스칼리온은 오늘 광산 일로 바빠.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:300
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_eb8b09a6:

    # MC "He couldn’t get the day off, not even for this?"
    MC "\"하루 쉬지도 못한 거야, 이런 날인데도?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:301
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_7c15d6ed:

    # MARKUS "No, unfortunately Demorai attacks have driven up the demand for ore trade, he couldn’t refuse the gold."
    MARKUS "\"아니, 안타깝게도 데모라이의 공격으로 광석 무역 수요가 치솟아서, 금을 거절할 수가 없었대.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:302
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_c6423a4b:

    # MC @ sad "Hmm... Still a shame..."
    MC @ sad "\"흠... 그래도 아쉽군...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:303
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_eb52465c:

    # MARKUS "Ha! Don’t worry too much, he’s promised us both a barrel of ale to celebrate once he gets back!"
    MARKUS "\"하! 너무 걱정 마, 돌아오면 축하한다고 우리 둘 다에게 맥주 한 통씩 쏘겠다고 약속했어!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:304
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3d75881d:

    # MC "No way! Almost glad he’s not here now!"
    MC "\"말도 안 돼! 그가 여기 없어서 거의 다행일 정도야!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:305
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_fe4f417e:

    # MARKUS "Uh-huh! Think of the girls we can entice over with that!"
    MARKUS "\"그래! 그걸로 여자애들을 얼마나 꼬실 수 있을지 생각해 봐!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:306
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_97891779:

    # MC "Heh, especially once we have our fancy palace uniforms! We’ll be rolling in—"
    MC "\"헤, 특히 우리가 근사한 왕궁 제복을 입게 되면! 우리는 완전—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:307
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_73863d95:

    # "Suddenly, a cute high-pitched voice called out from between the chattering waves of happy crowd. A hand waved desperately, trying to grab my attention."
    "갑자기, 즐거운 군중의 웅성거림 사이로 귀여운 높은 목소리가 울려 퍼졌다. 내 주목을 끌기 위해 필사적으로 손이 흔들렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:309
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_79b53c3f:

    # ADARA talk "[player_name!t]! [player_name!t]!"
    ADARA talk  "[player_name!t]! [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:310
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_26ce5014:

    # MARKUS "Oooh! Your future wife is here!"
    MARKUS "\"오오! 네 미래 신부가 왔어!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:312
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6928aee0:

    # MC smile "At least I won’t be dying alone like you!"
    MC "smile \"적어도 나는 너처럼 혼자 죽진 않겠네!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:313
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8aac5536:

    # MARKUS "Alright heartthrob, she’s been chasing you down since she first laid eyes on you!"
    MARKUS "\"좋아, 인기남. 그녀는 널 처음 본 순간부터 쫓아다녔잖아!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:314
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d205f56c:

    # "I rolled my eyes at Markus’ comment as he chuckled to himself, but he was right, Adara would do anything in her power to spend time with me in and out of class."
    "나는 마커스의 중얼거림에 눈을 굴렸지만, 그가 옳았다. 아다라는 수업 안팎에서 나와 시간을 보내기 위해 할 수 있는 건 뭐든 하는 아이였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:315
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_109c5624:

    # "Not that I didn’t like her, she was very cute... {i}but{/i} our studies took up so much time that socialising was a difficult thing to do, and near enough impossible if you aimed as high as me and Markus."
    "그녀를 싫어하는 건 아니었다. 그녀는 정말 귀여웠다... {i}하지만{/i} 학업이 너무 많은 시간을 잡아먹어서 사교 활동은 어려운 일이었고, 나와 마커스처럼 높은 곳을 목표로 한다면 거의 불가능에 가까웠다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:316
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_34dee6d3:

    # "Adara finally managed to break through the throngs of people to reach us."
    "아다라가 마침내 인파를 뚫고 우리에게 다가왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:317
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8c7b8a5b:

    # ADARA @ talk "{i}*Huff*{/i} Hey, both!"
    ADARA @ talk "\"{i}*헉*{/i} 어이, 둘 다!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:318
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_57f95235:

    # MARKUS "Did you {i}run{/i} all the way here?"
    MARKUS "\"여기까지 {i}뛰어{/i} 온 거야?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:319
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_5fa584c7:

    # ADARA @ talk "Huh?! Uh... N-No..."
    ADARA @ talk "\"어?! 어... 아-아니...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:320
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_20cb3f80:

    # MC smile "You overslept again, didn’t you?"
    MC "smile \"또 늦잠 잔 거지, 그렇지?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:321
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_eb3843b8:

    # "Adara became flustered as I caught onto her, but I knew her like the back of my hand."
    "내가 그녀의 속내를 알아채자 아다라는 당황했지만, 나는 그녀를 손바닥 보듯 잘 알고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:322
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_52f870a7:

    # ADARA @ angry "N-No!"
    ADARA @ angry "\"아-아니!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:323
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_de32d813:

    # "Markus and I shared a glance and chuckled."
    "마커스와 나는 시선을 주고받으며 피식 웃었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:324
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_decd3ea5:

    # ADARA @ talk "H-Hey! I DID NOT oversleep, guys!"
    ADARA @ talk "\"야-야! 나 안 늦잠 잤어, 얘들아!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:325
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_fb7301a1:

    # MARKUS "Long night dreaming about [player_name!t] was it? ... But I think I see Des over there, I’ll leave you two love birds alone for a bit!"
    MARKUS "\"[player_name!t] 꿈꾸느라 긴 밤 보낸 거지? ... 그런데 저쪽에 데스가 보이네, 너희 연인들끼리 잠시 둘만 있게 해줄게!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:326
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a0712279:

    # MC "We aren’t—"
    MC "\"우리는 그런—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:328
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_b3b10d33:

    # ADARA @ shock "W-What?! We are so not—"
    ADARA @ shock "\"뭐-뭐?! 우리는 절대 그런—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:329
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_73abf0ec:

    # MARKUS "Yeah, yeah!"
    MARKUS "\"그래, 그래!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:331
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_55c6dd2b:

    # "Markus left, fighting his way through the crowds as he called out to some classmates."
    "마커스는 몇몇 급우들에게 소리치며 군중 사이를 헤쳐 나가며 떠났다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:333
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_799ba0b6:

    # ADARA @ talk "He’s so infuriating when he talks about us like that!"
    ADARA @ talk "\"우리를 그런 식으로 말할 때 정말 열 받아!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:334
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_bcfa5447:

    # ADARA @ talk "... Right?"
    ADARA @ talk "\"... 그렇지?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:338
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_58904013:

    # ADARA @ talk "Hmm? Oh! Umm, maybe? It’s... It’s not really my thing..."
    ADARA @ talk "\"흠? 오! 음, 아마? 그건... 그건 내 취향이 별로...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:339
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_ba52742b:

    # MC "Ah, I see..."
    MC "\"아, 그렇구나...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:340
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2726822b:

    # ADARA @ talk "... But... if {i}you’re{/i} going, I guess I could come for a bit."
    ADARA @ talk "\"... 하지만... {i}네가{/i} 간다면, 나도 잠깐 갈 수 있을 것 같아.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:343
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d4caf7ad:

    # ADARA @ shock "E-Eh?!"
    ADARA @ shock "\"어-엥?!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:344
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0d0b8d7f:

    # ADARA @ talk "S-Stop saying such weird things!"
    ADARA @ talk "\"그-그런 이상한 말 하지 마!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:345
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2876ee01:

    # ADARA @ talk "{i}Idiot!{/i}"
    ADARA @ talk "\"{i}바보!{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:347
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_157c6b76:

    # ADARA @ talk "Oh... Right..."
    ADARA @ talk "\"오... 맞다...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:352
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_045c8eab:

    # "Interrupting us, the crowd suddenly roared with cheers as Queen Adelaide and King Mesamor came to the podium, smiling and waving down at us in their luxurious royal wear, their arrogant son absent as usual."
    "우리의 대화를 방해하듯, 군중은 갑자기 환호성을 터뜨렸다. 애들레이드 여왕과 메사모르 왕이 연단에 올라, 호화로운 왕실 의상을 입고 우리를 향해 미소 지으며 손을 흔들었다. 그들의 오만한 아들은 평소처럼 자리에 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:353
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_1394dc9c:

    # "The Queen was a beauty, there was no doubt about that. Many a crude joke had been told in private amongst boys wishing they were her personal squires, helping to {i}tend to ALL her needs...{/i}"
    "여왕은 미인이었다, 의심의 여지가 없었다. 많은 소년들이 그녀의 개인 시종이 되어 {i}그녀의 모든 필요를 돌보는{/i} 상상을 하며 은밀히 저속한 농담을 주고받곤 했다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:354
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0ce3c759:

    # "She was a woman who was respected, but she was not loved."
    "그녀는 존경받는 여인이었지만, 사랑받지는 못했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:355
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_65b84426:

    # "She did send money towards charity endeavours such as orphanages, but rarely wanted to be seen by the common people unless some official decorum demanded it, such as this occasion."
    "고아원 같은 자선 활동에 돈을 보내기는 했지만, 이런 공식 행사 같은 격식이 요구되지 않는 한 서민들 앞에 모습을 드러내려 하지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:356
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6590881b:

    # "Thankfully, she did not rule alone."
    "다행히도, 그녀가 혼자 통치하는 것은 아니었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:357
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0eb08be8:

    # "The King smiled, but his eyes were heavy, after all, it had been several years since he’d been deposed in 1156 by our ‘Emperor,’ and he now occupied only a figurehead position..."
    "왕은 미소 지었지만, 그의 눈은 무거웠다. 결국 1156년에 우리 '황제'에 의해 폐위된 지 여러 해가 지났고, 이제 그는 명목상의 자리만 차지하고 있었다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:358
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_304f39b7:

    # "{i}But...{/i} despite this, he remained popular amongst the people, a symbol of the will to keep persevering in the fight against the Demorai... even though he now had only a shadow of his former power."
    "{i}하지만...{/i} 그럼에도 불구하고, 그는 데모라이에 맞서 싸우려는 의지의 상징으로 사람들 사이에서 인기를 유지했다... 비록 이제는 과거 권력의 그림자만 남았을 뿐이었지만."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:359
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_5c0c262d:

    # "{i}Ironic,{/i} given that at the time the people would have had his head on a stick for his handling of the war."
    "{i}아이러니하게도,{/i} 당시에는 그가 전쟁을 처리한 방식 때문에 백성들이 그의 머리를 장대에 꽂았을 것이라는 점을 생각하면."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:360
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_206a036b:

    # "I guess that time allows people to romanticise anyone if enough of it goes by."
    "시간이 충분히 흐르면 사람들은 누구든 낭만화할 수 있게 되는 것 같다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:361
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_b2159af0:

    # ADARA @ talk "Where’s the Princess? Can you see her?"
    ADARA @ talk "\"걱정 때문인지 순수한 관음증적 호기심인지, 방 안의 거의 모든 시선이 우리에게로 향했다.\""

