translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_757e00c2:

    # "The woman shuffled through the envelopes stamped down with the red wax seal of the Royal Court, and after finding mine, handed it over to me which I snatched greedily from her hands."
    "여성은 왕실의 붉은 밀랍 인장이 찍힌 봉투들을 뒤적였고, 내 것을 찾아내자 내게 건넸고 나는 욕심스럽게 그녀의 손에서 낚아챘다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:501
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_70c7cba8:

    # WOMAN "Good luck!"
    WOMAN "\"행운을 빌어요!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:502
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_19f340fd:

    # MC "Thank you!"
    MC "\"고맙습니다!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:503
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_12fca38c:

    # "This is it! This is my destiny in my hands!"
    "이거다! 내 손에 내 운명이 쥐어져 있다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:504
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_403df7de:

    # "All these years of work are finally going to pay off!"
    "몇 년 동안의 노력이 마침내 결실을 맺는 순간이다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:505
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_40d11fb3:

    # "Feverishly, I ripped into the letter with sweaty hands, my heart beating frantically."
    "열광적으로, 땀에 젖은 손으로 편지를 찢어 열었다. 심장이 미친 듯이 뛰고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:520
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_85bbe6f7:

    # "I read that tiny bit of text a couple times over before it actually started to make sense..."
    "그 짧은 문장을 몇 번이고 읽은 뒤에야 비로소 내용이 이해되기 시작했다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:521
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_27570ac7:

    # MC "My... Training?"
    MC "\"내... 훈련병이라고?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:522
translate kr qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a20cefa7:

    "..."
    "..."

